# Journey: stage 1 from the Journey grid, flown by the rules bot's plan
# through two gates and then left to fall (`node tools/plan.mjs journey-01
# --crash-after 2`), so the results show the planned breakdown; Retry from
# the results starts the stage again, and the grid shows it still uncleared.
until 300 Play
frames 60
click Journey
until 60 Forty authored stages
frames 20
save journey
# the grid scrolls in the 960 × 540 check (play scripts click only outside
# scroll areas): the first stage has the focus, Enter opens it
key Enter 2
until 60 pass 10 gates
frames 10
save journey-setup
click Start
frames 170
# plan: # journey-01: floor at tick 337, 8 flaps, 2 gates, score 315
key Space 2
frames 41
key Space 2
frames 24
key Space 2
frames 36
key Space 2
frames 36
key Space 2
frames 36
key Space 2
frames 53
key Space 2
frames 35
key Space 2
frames 40
save journey-flying
# (the caption "[thud: flight ended]" shows first: wait on the table)
until 600 Gates passed
expect Flight ended
expect Gates passed
expect 315
frames 30
save journey-results
click Retry
until 60 Ember Dawn 1
frames 60
key Escape 2
until 30 Leave round
frames 10
click Leave round
until 60 You headed home early.
frames 10
click Menu
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Journey
until 60 Forty authored stages
expect 1Ember
